<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Prototypes are tools, n=
ot destinations:</strong> Don't get caught up trong prototype complexity. F=
ocus on solving business problems efficiently.</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Performance matters, bu=
t readability matters more:</strong> Premature optimization c=E1=BB=A7a pro=
totype chains often leads to unmaintainable code. Measure first, optimize s=
econd.</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Security is non-negotia=
ble:</strong> Prototype pollution isn't theoretical - n=C3=B3's a real atta=
ck vector trong production applications.</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Composition over inheri=
tance:</strong> Prototype-based mixins often better than deep inheritance h=
ierarchies.</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Know your execution con=
text:</strong> Prototypes behave differently across frames, workers, v=C3=
=A0 different environments.</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Memory management is cr=
ucial:</strong> Prototype chains can create subtle memory leaks trong long-=
running applications.</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Testing is essential:</=
strong> Prototype behavior has many edge cases. Comprehensive testing preve=
nts production surprises.</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Evolution continues:</s=
trong> JavaScript continues evolving. Stay updated v=E1=BB=9Bi new features=
 while maintaining prototype fundamentals.</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Remember: The goal isn't to show=
 off prototype knowledge, but to build robust, maintainable, performant app=
lications that solve real problems for real users. Prototypes are just one =
tool trong your toolkit - use them wisely."</p>
